        <Genie MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech">0.02</Genie>
        <Pigskin MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech">0.02</Pigskin>
        <Waster MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech">0.02</Waster>
        <Stoneborn MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,det.stoneborn">0.03</Stoneborn>
        <VRE_Insector MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,vanillaracesexpanded.insector">0.02</VRE_Insector>
        <Korg MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,sovereign.kork">0.02</Korg>
      </xenotypeChances>
    </xenotypeSet>
    <fixedIdeo>true</fixedIdeo>
    <ideoName>The Seal</ideoName>
    <ideoDescription>The doors opened, and the world they were waiting for didn't come with them. The vault kept them alive for generations below, every cell counted and every part kept going, and the overseer's word kept the count. When the water ran short the vault's council chose Overseer Hollis Crane to break the seal, and she walked out first into a world that had not waited. The dwellers mend what they can, trade what they must, and never forget a people who helped keep the lights on below.</ideoDescription>
    <forcedMemes>
      <li MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Ideology">Tunneler</li>
      <li MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Ideology">Loyalist</li>
      <!-- Patched with whatever is at hand: Vanilla Ideology Expanded's scrapper. -->
